{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":486536,"name":"Yum Cheng","username":"Yum_Cheng","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/e19adc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T14:35:57.681Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486536-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486536-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486536-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486536-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct: Grok Bot desktop (macOS)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSummary:\u003cbr\u003e\nAll bots fail with “Bot failed to respond — Something went wrong while generating the reply.”\u003cbr\u003e\nCannot create a new bot.\u003cbr\u003e\nReset Agent Computer also fails (computer appears stuck in a partial state).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried (no fix):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit (Cmd+Q) and reopen\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eiPhone hotspot (same failure)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset Agent Computer → reset cannot finish / partial state\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover the Agent Computer on the backend.\u003cbr\u003e\nI have stopped clicking Reset / Update / Recover / logout so nothing is overwritten.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDetails:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot version:\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003emacOS version: 0.44.0\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChip: Apple M4 Pro\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSigned-in email: \u003ca href=\"mailto:yumcheng9546@gmail.com\"\u003eyumcheng9546@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTimezone: Asia/Hong_Kong\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486536-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486536-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on macOS and sign in with my SuperGrok account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen any existing bot (or try Create new bot).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a simple message such as “hello” with no tools, connectors, search, or memory.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWithin a few seconds the app returns: “Bot failed to respond — Something went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRepeat on iPhone hotspot instead of home Wi-Fi. Same error.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot (Cmd+Q), reopen, and send “hello” again. Same error.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGo to Settings and run Reset Agent Computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset fails and does not complete (computer appears stuck in a partial state). Creating a new bot also fails.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis happens on every bot, not one conversation. I have stopped retrying Reset so the backend computer is not overwritten.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486536-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486536-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/0/e/0e3fa9d9d0de061b9e2ddb8e1dbd4cd11a6b1a1a.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/22358UmsBFB6R7Teyz4zPMqBXD4.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-08 at 10.34.27 PM.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/e/0e3fa9d9d0de061b9e2ddb8e1dbd4cd11a6b1a1a_2_286x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-08 at 10.34.27 PM.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"22358UmsBFB6R7Teyz4zPMqBXD4\" width=\"286\" height=\"